---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SOCIAL } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Peter Friedrich — data scientist and machine learning practitioner."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    I'm a data scientist and machine learning practitioner with a BSc in
    mechanical engineering.
  </p>

  <p>
    The engineering background is why I tend to start from the measurement
    rather than the model: what was actually counted, by whom, and what the
    number stops meaning at the edges. Most of what I build is applied — public
    and civic datasets, visualizations that have to survive someone disagreeing
    with them, and the pipelines underneath.
  </p>

  <h2>What I care about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Responsible development and use of ML models and applications.</li>
    <li>Social-good work and volunteering, including hackathons and data dives.</li>
    <li>Analysis that is reproducible by someone who isn't me.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
  <ul>
    {SOCIAL.map((link) => (
      <li><a href={link.href} rel="me noopener">{link.label}</a></li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <!-- TODO(content): rewrite this page in your own voice — it is stitched from
